+	// Runs one slide from the outgoing item to the incoming one. Each door reads the items for its
+	// phase: the outgoing item keeps the `active` token and the incoming item lacks it until the
+	// completion moves it, the incoming item carries its order token from its write until the
+	// completion removes it, and each item carries the direction token from its write until the
+	// completion removes it.
+	async #move(
+		outgoing: HTMLElement,
+		incoming: HTMLElement,
